  "id": "mtg",
  "term": "MTG",
  "definition": "MTG refers to a region of the temporal cortex discussed here as part of the middle temporal areas. In this study, the anterior MTG showed the strongest specificity for human voices, responding more to voices than to animal or musical-instrument sounds.",
