      "reasons": [
        "The first sentence (“MTG refers to a region of the temporal cortex discussed here as part of the middle temporal areas”) is not directly supported by the provided packet text, which mentions “anterior MTG” and voice-selective activation but does not define MTG as “part of the middle temporal areas.”",
        "Although the packet supports that “anterior MTG” shows stronger responses to human voices than to animal and musical-instrument sounds (and only voices increase BOLD above resting baseline), it does not explicitly claim “strongest specificity” in the wording of the definition."
